  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART1<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART1\"> </a></td><td>ART1 (TX_NEW)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV newly started on ART during the month, excluding ART transfer-in.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART2<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART2\"> </a></td><td>ART2 (TX_CURR)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV currently receiving ART during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART3<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART3\"> </a></td><td>ART3 (TX_PVLS_D)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART for at least six months with a viral-load test result within the last 12 months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART4<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART4\"> </a></td><td>ART4 (TX_PVLS_N)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART for at least six months with virologic suppression of 1000 copies/mL or less within the last 12 months.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART5<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART5\"> </a></td><td>ART5 (TX_ATRR)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART who had treatment interruption during the reporting month, disaggregated by tracking outcome.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART6<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART6\"> </a></td><td>ART6 (TX_RTT)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV who restarted ART during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART7<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART7\"> </a></td><td>ART7 (TX_TO)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV who transferred out during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART8<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART8\"> </a></td><td>ART8 (TX_TI)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV who transferred in during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART9<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART9\"> </a></td><td>ART9 (ART_INSURANCE)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART with current health-insurance cover.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART10<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART10\"> </a></td><td>ART10 (TX_TB_SCRN)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART, including PMTCT clients, who were clinically screened for TB in HIV treatment settings.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART11<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART11\"> </a></td><td>ART11 (TX_TB_SCRN_POS)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART with presumptive TB during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART12<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART12\"> </a></td><td>ART12 (TX_TB_TST)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART with presumptive TB who were tested for TB during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART13<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART13\"> </a></td><td>ART13 (TX_TB_TST_POS)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART who had active TB disease.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART14<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART14\"> </a></td><td>ART14 (TX_TB)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART with active TB disease who initiated TB treatment.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART15<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART15\"> </a></td><td>ART15 (TB_PREV_D)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART who initiated TB preventive treatment.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART16<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART16\"> </a></td><td>ART16 (TB_PREV_N)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV on ART who completed a course of TB preventive treatment among those who initiated it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART17<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART17\"> </a></td><td>ART17 (TB_PREV_EVR)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV currently on ART who had ever received TB preventive treatment.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART18<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART18\"> </a></td><td>ART18 (CARE_NEW)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV newly enrolled in care during the month.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART19<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART19\"> </a></td><td>ART19 (AHD_SCRN)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV with advanced HIV disease: WHO clinical stage 3 or 4, CD4 below 200 cells/mm3, or child aged five years or younger.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART20<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART20\"> </a></td><td>ART20 (AHD_SCRN_CRAG)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV with advanced HIV disease screened for serum cryptococcal antigen.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART21<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART21\"> </a></td><td>ART21 (AHD_SCRN_CSF)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV with advanced HIV disease and positive serum CrAg who were screened for cryptococcal meningitis by lumbar puncture.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART22<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART22\"> </a></td><td>ART22 (AHD_MEN_TX)</td><td>Number of people living with HIV started on treatment for cryptococcal meningitis.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART23<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART23\"> </a></td><td>ART23 (CER_SCRN)</td><td>Number of women living with HIV on ART screened for cervical cancer.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ART24<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ART24\"> </a></td><td>ART24 (CER_TX)</td><td>Number of women living with HIV on ART who screened positive, were eligible for treatment, and received cryotherapy, thermal ablation or LEEP.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">artAgeGroup<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-artAgeGroup\"> </a></td><td>ART age group</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">sex<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-sex\"> </a></td><td>Sex</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">keyPopulation<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-keyPopulation\"> </a></td><td>Key-population typology</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">regimenLine<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-regimenLine\"> </a></td><td>ART regimen line</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">mmdDuration<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-mmdDuration\"> </a></td><td>Multi-month dispensing duration</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">interruptionOutcome<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-interruptionOutcome\"> </a></td><td>Treatment-interruption outcome</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tbAhdAgeGroup<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-tbAhdAgeGroup\"> </a></td><td>TB and AHD age group</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">tptRegimen<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-tptRegimen\"> </a></td><td>TB preventive-treatment regimen</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ahdCategory<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-ahdCategory\"> </a></td><td>Advanced-HIV-disease entry category</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cragAgeGroup<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cragAgeGroup\"> </a></td><td>CrAg age group</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cragResult<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cragResult\"> </a></td><td>Serum CrAg result</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cryptococcalMeningitisResult<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cryptococcalMeningitisResult\"> </a></td><td>Cryptococcal-meningitis screening result</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cervicalAgeGroup<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cervicalAgeGroup\"> </a></td><td>Cervical-screening age group</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cervicalScreeningResult<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cervicalScreeningResult\"> </a></td><td>Cervical-screening result</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cervicalScreeningTiming<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cervicalScreeningTiming\"> </a></td><td>Cervical-screening timing</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">cervicalTreatmentType<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-cervicalTreatmentType\"> </a></td><td>Cervical treatment type</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-lt-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-lt-1\"> </a></td><td>Younger than 1 year</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-1-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-1-4\"> </a></td><td>1–4 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-5-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-5-9\"> </a></td><td>5–9 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-10-14<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-10-14\"> </a></td><td>10–14 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-15-19<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-15-19\"> </a></td><td>15–19 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-20-24<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-20-24\"> </a></td><td>20–24 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-25-49<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-25-49\"> </a></td><td>25–49 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-50-plus<a name=\"ng-hiv-art-monthly-summary-cs-age-50-plus\"> </a></td><td>50 years or older</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">age-lt-5<a name=\"ng-